#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:1
#: a60626f85a604bbd837b39bc09598eca
msgid "浏览与基础选择"
msgstr "Navigation and Basic Selection"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:3
#: 8ede58c69f2547429a515dad1fb0b286
msgid "对应 `重置视图`、`平移视图`、`鼠标选择`、`反选`、 `删除选中项`、`撤销选择` 和 `撤销删除`。"
msgstr "This section covers `Reset View`, `Pan View`, `Mouse Selection`, `Invert selection`, `Delete selected items`, `Undo selection`, and `Undo delete`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:6
#: 35c2eed4104840e7bc6076f7efb8452b
msgid "这些工具会改变什么"
msgstr "What These Tools Change"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:8
#: 1955364fcf61497b82dd15a5a500a178
#
msgid "`重置视图` 和 `平移视图` 只改变当前图的观察范围，不改结构和选择。"
msgstr ""
"`Reset View` and `Pan View` only change the visible plot range; they do "
"not modify structures or the selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:9
#: db971a33140e42c1b92673d7b394fe66
msgid "`鼠标选择`、`反选` 和 `撤销选择` 改变选择集，适合在图上逐步圈出目标结构。"
msgstr "`Mouse Selection`, `Invert selection`, and `Undo selection` change the selection set and support incremental selection directly on the plot."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:10
#: e062cec94230401faf3f38405103a3d7
msgid "`删除选中项` 把选中结构移出活动数据集；`撤销删除` 可以恢复最近一次删除。"
msgstr "`Delete selected items` removes selected structures from the active dataset; `Undo delete` restores the most recent deletion."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:12
#: 7d2ee304556a428694dbbcac3bb5d46a
msgid "选择、标记和删除是三种不同状态。操作后看底部 `Sel / Rej / Rm / Now`，确认变化落在预期状态。"
msgstr ""
"Selection, rejection marking, and deletion are distinct states. After an "
"operation, check `Sel / Rej / Rm / Now` at the bottom to confirm that the"
" intended state changed."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:14
#: 9635d51e6e75498ba6098938d4fa0be4
msgid "按钮行为"
msgstr "Button Behavior"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 24d1a5c8244742bcaa52fb5bd7a135bc
msgid "按钮"
msgstr "Buttons"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 85ee9d6f9858411db9407ede9b613e20
msgid "行为"
msgstr "Behavior"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 39e1ba8b79a0426381a5f7b2aa52e47b
msgid "`重置视图`"
msgstr "`Reset View`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 55d3394e368d43c9b1dce761f2b3505f
msgid "当前子图自动缩放回数据范围"
msgstr "Fit the current subplot to its data range"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 4c2abd9e7233425cbb4b89e42bfb614a
msgid "`平移视图`"
msgstr "`Pan View`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 3b491821d8fe44e5bd57361f69398043
msgid "切换平移交互"
msgstr "Toggle pan interaction"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: afdcac5f0d7142928d8c2dc4fc77d89a
msgid "`鼠标选择`"
msgstr "`Mouse Selection`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: d484e2535e09458ebf56397ce91e745e
msgid "切换多边形/点选交互"
msgstr "Toggle polygon/point selection"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 8aa9579d6efe4b8f9d6386bc8d06e6bd
msgid "`反选`"
msgstr "`Invert selection`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: e681509bc9cc439d98bcc50f50783639
msgid "对当前活动结构集合执行反选"
msgstr "Invert the selection within the active structure set"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 1637953e9f544046bd1aa56730e153e9
msgid "`删除选中项`"
msgstr "`Delete selected items`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: bfeed4871dc243fe8831b6fc7282de77
msgid "删除选中结构并重绘"
msgstr "Delete selected structures and redraw"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 0a49f230382a471b9a34e777e0190a31
msgid "`撤销选择`"
msgstr "`Undo selection`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: c467cbaf0e4c41e8ad5d2fec498f75ec
msgid "撤销最近一次选择变化；无可撤销时提示 `没有可撤销的选择操作！`"
msgstr "Undo the latest selection change; shows `No undoable selection!` when there is nothing to undo"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: dade0e2bd5d44dccbb3b7e8fd350de01
msgid "`撤销删除`"
msgstr "`Undo delete`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:16
#: 72d454bd046b4db0a1cf92e91b3d7a6b
msgid "撤销最近删除；无可撤销时提示 `没有可撤销的删除操作！`"
msgstr "Undo the latest deletion; shows `No undoable deletion!` when there is nothing to undo"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:21
#: a205b218f8684f099a9c224806deb063
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-basic.md:23
#: e9d0822f6dc24316a105807215213194
#
msgid "先确认选中点数量，再执行删除或导出。误选时优先用 `撤销选择`，不要通过删除再恢复来代替选择撤销。"
msgstr "Confirm the number of selected points before deleting or exporting. After an accidental selection, use `Undo selection`; do not substitute delete-and-restore for selection undo."
